{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"积 (范畴论)"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"积(范畴论)"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>积</strong> (product), 是以集合 (离散范畴) 为指标的"},{"Local":{"url":"极限","text":"极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"和 (范畴论)"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}